                24
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "I7QEQV",
                  "name": "段1",
                  "fill": "$text-strong",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "过去十年，软件工程的瓶颈一直在「写代码」这件事上。我们反复优化的都是同一个动作：把想法转译成可运行的代码。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.9,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Bk51I",
                  "name": "段2",
                  "fill": "$text-strong",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "但当 Agent 能够可靠地完成转译，瓶颈就转移了。工程师真正稀缺的能力，变成了如何描述问题、拆解任务、验证结果。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.9,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "QeCZP",
                  "name": "H2",
                  "fill": "$text-strong",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "什么是 Harness",
                  "lineHeight": 1.35,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IwLLY",
                  "name": "段3",
                  "fill": "$text-strong",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Harness 指的是包裹在模型外层的那套工程结构：上下文如何组织、工具如何暴露、结果如何校验、失败如何恢复。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.9,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Uyc0u",
                  "name": "引用",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": "$accent",
                  "strokeWidth": {
