              "name": "颜色规范扩展",
              "fill": "$surface-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "颜色规范补充\npage-bg：页面背景，只用于大面积底色。\nsurface / surface-tint：正文块、表格、浅底模块。\nsurface-hover：文章卡片、导航项、页脚链接 hover 背景。\nsurface-pressed：按钮或卡片按下状态。\naccent / accent-hover：当前导航、链接、主按钮与回到顶部按钮。\ntag-bg：文章页标签、专栏标识的浅色背景。\nhairline：分割线和表格边框；宽屏时跟随内容容器，不贯穿全屏。",
              "lineHeight": 1.85,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "P6CAg5",
              "name": "交互状态",
              "fill": "$surface-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "交互状态\n导航 hover：文字使用 accent，图标使用 accent-hover。\n文章卡片 hover：surface-hover 背景 + 标题 accent + 右侧箭头出现。\n按钮 hover：浅色按钮使用 surface-hover，主按钮使用 accent-hover，回到顶部按钮保持圆形浮动。",
              "lineHeight": 1.85,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Serif SC",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
