                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "fHp2d",
                  "name": "双栏布局",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 44,
                  "padding": 44,
                  "justifyContent": "center",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "EBlPC",
                      "name": "正文列",
                      "width": 680,
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 24,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "TASDS",
                          "name": "段1",
                          "fill": "$text-strong",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "过去十年，软件工程的瓶颈一直在「写代码」这件事上。我们用更好的语言、框架和工具，反复优化的都是同一个动作：把想法转译成可运行的代码。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.9,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                          "fontSize": 17,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "VW5jN",
                          "name": "段2",
                          "fill": "$text-strong",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "但当 Agent 能够可靠地完成转译，瓶颈就转移了。工程师真正稀缺的能力，变成了如何描述问题、如何拆解任务、如何验证结果——也就是「方法」本身。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.9,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                          "fontSize": 17,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "vZym0",
                          "name": "H2",
                          "fill": "$text-strong",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "什么是 Harness",
                          "lineHeight": 1.3,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                          "fontSize": 26,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "plfCA",
                          "name": "段3",
                          "fill": "$text-strong",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Harness 指的是包裹在模型外层的那套工程结构：上下文如何组织、工具如何暴露、结果如何校验、失败如何恢复。它决定了同样一个模型，在你手里能发挥几成功力。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.9,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                          "fontSize": 17,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "A51IG",
                          "name": "引用",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "stroke": "$accent",
                          "strokeWidth": {
                            "left": 3
                          },
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "padding": [
                            4,
                            0,
                            4,
                            20
                          ],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "qe5RQ",
                              "name": "引文",
                              "fill": "$text-muted",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "模型决定能力的上限，Harness 决定你能稳定拿到其中的多少。",
                              "lineHeight": 1.8,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                              "fontSize": 17,
                              "fontWeight": "normal",
                              "fontStyle": "italic"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "z9sXK",
                          "name": "H2b",
                          "fill": "$text-strong",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "三个实践原则",
                          "lineHeight": 1.3,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                          "fontSize": 26,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "T00yM",
                          "name": "段4",
                          "fill": "$text-strong",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "第一，让验证比生成更便宜。第二，把上下文当作一等公民来设计。第三，为失败设计恢复路径，而不是假设一次成功。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.9,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
                          "fontSize": 17,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
